-nvidia-employee-meeting.html</link><description>英伟达首席执行官黄仁勋因多起婚外情报道而辞职，其中包括与一名被指控为北京间谍的中国女商人的婚外情。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 3 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[CNBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/24/jensen-huang-nvidia-employee-meeting.html'&gt;黄仁勋告诉员工英伟达不需要继任计划&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Jensen Huang tells staff that Nvidia doesn't need a succession plan&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/technology/jensen-huang-apology-nvidia-ceo.html'&gt;黄仁勋向 Nvidia 员工道歉并表示正在接受治疗&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Jensen Huang Apologizes to Nvidia Employees, Says He Is in Therapy&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[金融时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.ft.com/content/cd1831d0-c3f1-4705-b8e2-badfb5e39764?syn-25a6b1a6=1'&gt;黄仁勋表示，他仍然不相信英伟达首席执行官继任计划&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Huang says he still does not believe in CEO succession planning at Nvidia&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/24/jensen-huang-nvidia-employee-meeting.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:13:49 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[路透社等2家] 委内瑞拉公布2375亿美元债务，这是重组的关键一步</title><link>https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxOakxRRS1xODNKVEMzdlowcjUzd2g4amNoV0JSSzdQc0JEUXg1WWxSbGxOaGhYWDZWSlQzeldBelpvUnpXb3g3bHdMUWd4NWhiZFJRZnEtSWU4TDBXS0Q1Q21CWE9QUkxkT2YxYVI5MzlJNkVJS3FRZ3NuMG90Y0JBMFNKRGEtOEhlOUktTVJwU2hoSHVVVW56NXI0ZlZIOHo3TGt0UTc3VnA4VlV5MGZoTmlfS05qQlpQcWpiUWNtSjI?oc=5</link><description>（据华尔街日报摘要）高于预期的数字凸显了美国支持的临时政府面临的挑战。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 2 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[路透社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxOakxRRS1xODNKVEMzdlowcjUzd2g4amNoV0JSSzdQc0JEUXg1WWxSbGxOaGhYWDZWSlQzeldBelpvUnpXb3g3bHdMUWd4NWhiZFJRZnEtSWU4TDBXS0Q1Q21CWE9QUkxkT2YxYVI5MzlJNkVJS3FRZ3NuMG90Y0JBMFNKRGEtOEhlOUktTVJwU2hoSHVVVW56NXI0ZlZIOHo3TGt0UTc3VnA4VlV5MGZoTmlfS05qQlpQcWpiUWNtSjI?oc=5'&gt;委内瑞拉公布2375亿美元债务，这是重组的关键一步&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Venezuela reveals $237.5 billion debt pile in key step towards restructuring&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[华尔街日报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.wsj.com/world/americas/venezuela-reveals-an-eye-popping-debt-load-of-237-billion-16bddcde?mod=rss_worldnews'&gt;委内瑞拉债务负担高达 2370 亿美元&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Venezuela Reveals an Eye-Popping Debt Load of $237 Billion&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxOakxRRS1xODNKVEMzdlowcjUzd2g4amNoV0JSSzdQc0JEUXg1WWxSbGxOaGhYWDZWSlQzeldBelpvUnpXb3g3bHdMUWd4NWhiZFJRZnEtSWU4TDBXS0Q1Q21CWE9QUkxkT2YxYVI5MzlJNkVJS3FRZ3NuMG90Y0JBMFNKRGEtOEhlOUktTVJwU2hoSHVVVW56NXI0ZlZIOHo3TGt0UTc3VnA4VlV5MGZoTmlfS05qQlpQcWpiUWNtSjI?oc=5</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:14:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[纽约时报] 当调查人员检查公司客户时，布兰奇淡化了对英伟达的质疑</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/us/politics/nvidia-justice-department-todd-blanche.html</link><description>据知情人士透露，司法部调查人员已收集证据，证明英伟达的高性能计算机芯片被其他公司非法转移到中国。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/us/politics/nvidia-justice-department-todd-blanche.html'&gt;当调查人员检查公司客户时，布兰奇淡化了对英伟达的质疑&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Blanche Downplays Questions Over Nvidia as Investigators Examine Company’s Customers&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/us/politics/nvidia-justice-department-todd-blanche.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:27:36 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[纽约时报] 爱荷华州即将发生爆炸。居民对此无能为力。</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/us/iowa-ammunition-plant-lead-explosion-middletown.html</link><description>米德尔敦毗邻一处陆军设施，周三将在那里引爆危险化学品，居民们正在用胶带封住门，准备逃离。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/us/iowa-ammunition-plant-lead-e